{"seq":2,"slug":"html-css-paged-media-layout","title":"HTML/CSS 分页媒体与版式模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/document-pdf-label-generation-engineering/rendering-architecture-html-to-pdf/html-css-paged-media-layout","wordCount":2338,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"html-css-分页媒体与版式模型\">HTML/CSS 分页媒体与版式模型</h1><p>跨境电商的订单确认单、装箱单、发票与合规声明最终都要落成一张张固定尺寸的纸（或等效的 PDF 页面）。屏幕上的 CSS 关心的是「浏览器窗口有多宽」，而分页媒体要回答的是「这张纸的物理尺寸是多少、内容在纸上的哪块区域流动、在哪里被迫断开、断点周围的页眉页脚从哪里取数」。这三个问题的答案分别由 <code>@page</code> 规则、内容区与页边盒（margin boxes）、以及碎片化（fragmentation）属性给出。不理解这三层，任何 HTML→PDF 管线都只是在赌编辑器「看起来对了」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分页媒体与连续媒体（continuous media）的本质区别在于：屏幕是一个可以无限滚动的视口，而纸张有确定的边界，溢出必须被切分到下一页。CSS Paged Media Module Level 3（W3C Working Draft，2023-09-14，见 <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/css-page-3/\">w3.org/TR/css-page-3</a>）把这件事形式化为一个盒子模型：一张纸（sheet）上放一个<strong>页面盒</strong>（page box），页面盒由外边距（margins）围出<strong>页面区域</strong>（page area），正文在该区域内流动；四周的外边距里则排列最多 16 个<strong>页边盒</strong>，专供页码、页眉、公司抬头这类不参与主文档流的生成内容。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Sheet[&quot;纸张 sheet&lt;br/&gt;= size 决定物理尺寸&quot;] --&gt; PageBox[&quot;页面盒 page box&lt;br/&gt;= sheet 减去四边 margin&quot;]&#10;    PageBox --&gt; PageArea[&quot;页面区域 page area&lt;br/&gt;承载 document flow&quot;]&#10;    PageBox --&gt; MarginBox[&quot;页边盒 margin boxes&lt;br/&gt;@top-center / @bottom-right …&quot;]&#10;    PageArea --&gt; Frag1[&quot;分片 fragment&lt;br/&gt;page 1 的内容&quot;]&#10;    PageArea --&gt; Frag2[&quot;分片 fragment&lt;br/&gt;page 2 的内容&quot;]&#10;    Frag1 --&gt; Break[&quot;分页点由&lt;br/&gt;break-before/after/inside 决定&quot;]&#10;    Frag2 --&gt; Break&#10;    MarginBox --&gt; Counter[&quot;page / pages 计数器&lt;br/&gt;与 running header&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Sheet[\"纸张 sheet&lt;br/&gt;= size 决定物理尺寸\"] --&gt; PageBox[\"页面盒 page box&lt;br/&gt;= sheet 减去四边 margin\"]\n    PageBox --&gt; PageArea[\"页面区域 page area&lt;br/&gt;承载 document flow\"]\n    PageBox --&gt; MarginBox[\"页边盒 margin boxes&lt;br/&gt;@top-center / @bottom-right …\"]\n    PageArea --&gt; Frag1[\"分片 fragment&lt;br/&gt;page 1 的内容\"]\n    PageArea --&gt; Frag2[\"分片 fragment&lt;br/&gt;page 2 的内容\"]\n    Frag1 --&gt; Break[\"分页点由&lt;br/&gt;break-before/after/inside 决定\"]\n    Frag2 --&gt; Break\n    MarginBox --&gt; Counter[\"page / pages 计数器&lt;br/&gt;与 running header\"]</pre><p>页面区域的可用尺寸由纸张尺寸减去外边距得出，这是排版计算里最先要固定下来的量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{area} = W_{sheet} - m_{left} - m_{right}, \\qquad H_{area} = H_{sheet} - m_{top} - m_{bottom}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一个连续文档流被切成多少片，下界约等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil H_{flow} / H_{area} \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span>，但真实页数由强制与避免断点的规则共同决定，永远不能只靠这个除法预测。下表对比了两类媒体的关键差异，这也是为什么同一份 HTML 在屏幕预览与 PDF 输出下版式会完全不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>连续媒体（screen）</th>\n<th>分页媒体（paged）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>视口</td>\n<td>单一、可滚动、宽度可变</td>\n<td>多张固定尺寸的纸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分页概念</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有，<code>page</code> 盒 + <code>pages</code> 计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溢出处理</td>\n<td>滚动/裁剪</td>\n<td>强制碎片化到下一页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页眉页脚</td>\n<td>用固定定位模拟</td>\n<td><code>@page</code> 页边盒原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断点控制</td>\n<td>无意义</td>\n<td><code>break-before/after/inside</code> 生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺寸来源</td>\n<td>视口宽高</td>\n<td><code>size</code> 描述符 / <code>@page</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>@page</code> 规则在无头 PDF 渲染里还会被一个开关左右：Chrome DevTools Protocol 的 <code>Page.printToPDF</code> 提供 <code>preferCSSPageSize</code> 参数，当它为 <code>true</code> 时，CSS <code>size</code> 描述符优先于调用方传入的 <code>paperWidth</code>/<code>paperHeight</code>。把它设成 <code>false</code> 会让排版引擎里的一整套物理尺寸声明被静默忽略——这是「本地预览正确、线上 PDF 尺寸错乱」最常见的根因之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"page-规则与页面选择器\">@page 规则与页面选择器</h2><p><code>@page</code> 规则描述纸张本身，而不是其中的内容。它接受 <code>size</code>、<code>margin</code>、<code>bleed</code>、<code>marks</code> 等描述符，并支持若干<strong>页面选择器</strong>（page selectors）来区分不同的页：<code>:first</code> 命中第一页，<code>:left</code> / <code>:right</code> 命中双面印刷时的左右页，<code>:blank</code> 命中由强制分页产生的空白页。下面是跨境电商装箱单常见的写法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@page {&#10;  size: A4 portrait;&#10;  margin: 18mm 16mm 20mm 16mm;&#10;}&#10;&#10;@page :first {&#10;  margin-top: 40mm;&#10;}&#10;&#10;@page letter-page {&#10;  size: Letter;&#10;  margin: 0.75in;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.commercial-invoice {&#10;  page: letter-page;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: A4 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">portrait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  margin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">mm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">mm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">mm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">mm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@page</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> :first</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  margin-top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">mm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> letter-page {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Letter;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  margin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.commercial-invoice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: letter-page;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>size</code> 可以写成 <code>A4</code>、<code>Letter</code> 这类具名尺寸，也可以写成两个长度值。<code>page</code> 属性把某个元素分配给一个<strong>具名页</strong>（named page），同一份文档里混排 A4 的条款页与 Letter 的发票页，靠的就是这个机制。<code>page-orientation</code>（<code>upright</code> / <code>rotate-left</code> / <code>rotate-right</code>）用于在布局完成后再旋转某几页的输出，W3C 明确把它定位为宽度或方向不同的页面混排难以自然实现时的过渡方案——不要指望它在所有引擎里表现一致。</p>\n<p>一个容易被忽略的语义是：页面盒的 <code>margin</code> 与页边盒不是同一层。<code>margin</code> 决定了正文在哪里停止、页边盒在哪里开始；如果你把 <code>margin</code> 设成 0，页边盒就没有空间放置内容，页码与页眉会直接消失。这是「加了 <code>@top-center</code> 却什么都不显示」类问题的标准答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分页控制与碎片化\">分页控制与碎片化</h2><p>碎片化规则决定内容流在哪里被切开。核心属性是 <code>break-before</code>、<code>break-after</code>、<code>break-inside</code>，CSS 2.1 遗留的 <code>page-break-before</code> / <code>page-break-after</code> / <code>page-break-inside</code> 是它们的别名，语义上映射到同一组值（<code>auto</code> / <code>avoid</code> / <code>page</code> 等），且由 CSS Fragmentation Module 而非 Paged Media 模块定义。<code>widows</code> 与 <code>orphans</code> 控制段落被切开时上下页各自至少保留的行数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"h2 {&#10;  break-after: avoid;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.order-line-item {&#10;  break-inside: avoid;&#10;}&#10;&#10;table.line-items tr {&#10;  break-inside: avoid;&#10;}&#10;&#10;p {&#10;  widows: 3;&#10;  orphans: 3;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  break-after</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avoid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.order-line-item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  break-inside</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avoid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.line-items</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> tr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  break-inside</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avoid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  widows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  orphans</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>break-inside: avoid</code> 加在表格行上，是防止「一条商品明细被劈成上下两半」的关键；加在章节标题上的 <code>break-after: avoid</code> 则避免标题孤零零留在页底、正文跑到下一页。但 <code>avoid</code> 是<strong>请求</strong>而非<strong>保证</strong>：当一个不可分割块本身高于一整页时，引擎必须放弃 avoid 把它切开，否则就会陷入无法排版的死循环。给明细行设一个最大高度、或让超长描述单独成页，比单纯堆 <code>break-inside: avoid</code> 更可靠。</p>\n<p>分页还引入了「页数与内容互相影响」的反馈问题：给某段加了避免断点，可能把后续内容整体推后一页，从而改变总页数，进而改变依赖 <code>pages</code> 计数器的页脚文案。因此凡是涉及目录页码、<code>Page X of Y</code> 的声明，都必须把断点规则<strong>先定稿</strong>再生成，不能一边调断点一边信任既有的总页数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"页边盒与生成内容\">页边盒与生成内容</h2><p>页边盒是分页媒体最强、也最不被用足的能力。页面四条边各有一个角盒加三个边盒，共 16 个：<code>@top-left-corner</code>、<code>@top-left</code>、<code>@top-center</code>、<code>@top-right</code>、<code>@top-right-corner</code>，右侧三个（<code>@right-top</code>/<code>@right-middle</code>/<code>@right-bottom</code>）、底部五个、左侧三个，命名对称。它们各自是一个独立的格式化上下文，只能承载生成内容（字符串、计数器、图片），不能承载主文档流的元素——这是「为什么我的页眉里放不进正文的一段」的答案。</p>\n<p>内置的 <code>page</code> 与 <code>pages</code> 计数器提供了最基本的动态内容：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@page {&#10;  @bottom-right {&#10;    content: &#39;第 &#39; counter(page) &#39; / &#39; counter(pages) &#39; 页&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;  @top-center {&#10;    content: &#39;Commercial Invoice — &#39; string(invoice-no);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;.invoice-number {&#10;  string-set: invoice-no content();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  @</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bottom-right</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'第 '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> counter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' / '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> counter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' 页'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  @top-center</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: 'Commercial Invoice — ' string(</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">invoice-no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.invoice-number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  string-set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: invoice-no </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>string-set</code> 把正文里某个元素的值抽成一个<strong>命名字符串</strong>，页边盒再用 <code>string()</code> 取到它，这样跨页的发票号抬头会随当前页所属区块自动更新。与之相近的还有<strong>running elements</strong>（GCPM：<code>position: running(...)</code> + <code>element()</code>），它让你把正文里一个完整的 DOM 元素（比如带 logo 的页眉块）移到页边盒里复用。两者的差别是：<code>string-set</code> 只能搬运文本，running elements 搬运的是有样式的元素。</p>\n<p>生成内容在无头渲染里还有一个陷阱：Chrome 的 <code>Page.printToPDF</code> 另外提供了一套 <code>displayHeaderFooter</code> + <code>headerTemplate</code>/<code>footerTemplate</code> 的原生页眉页脚，它渲染在<strong>页面盒的系统边距</strong>里，与 CSS <code>@page</code> 页边盒是两套互不通气的机制。二者同时启用时，CSS 页边盒可能被原生页脚覆盖。工程上应当二选一：要么全部交给 CSS <code>@page</code>（配合 <code>preferCSSPageSize</code>，可控性最好），要么全部交给 <code>printToPDF</code> 模板（在 Studio 里能直接传 HTML 片段）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无头引擎的实现差异\">无头引擎的实现差异</h2><p>同一份 CSS 在不同引擎里的支持面差异很大，选型前必须核对而不是假设。WeasyPrint 70.0（<a href=\"https://doc.courtbouillon.org/weasyprint/stable/\">doc.courtbouillon.org</a>）在其文档中声明「CSS Paged Media Level 3 草案的全部特性均可用」，包括 <code>:left</code>/<code>:right</code>/<code>:first</code>/<code>:blank</code>、页边盒、页面计数器、<code>size</code>/<code>bleed</code>/<code>marks</code>、具名页，以及 GCPM 的 running elements、脚注、<code>target-counter()</code> 交叉引用与 PDF 书签；其 <code>break-before/after/inside</code> 仅对<strong>分页</strong>生效，不支持列与区域方向的断点。Chrome 系（自 Chrome 132 起，无头与有头统一，旧的独立无头实现仅以 <code>chrome-headless-shell</code> 形式保留，见 <a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/chromium/headless\">developer.chrome.com/docs/chromium/headless</a>）通过 DevTools Protocol 的 <a href=\"https://chromedevtools.github.io/devtools-protocol/tot/Page/\"><code>Page.printToPDF</code></a> 输出，支持 <code>printBackground</code>、<code>preferCSSPageSize</code>、<code>paperWidth</code>/<code>paperHeight</code>、<code>margin*</code>、<code>scale</code>、<code>pageRanges</code> 等参数，但页边盒与 GCPM 的支持远弱于 WeasyPrint。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>WeasyPrint 70</th>\n<th>Chrome printToPDF</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@page</code> 尺寸/边距</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持（注意 <code>preferCSSPageSize</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页边盒（16 个）</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>部分/不可靠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>:left</code>/<code>:right</code>/<code>:first</code>/<code>:blank</code></td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>running elements / 脚注</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>break-inside: avoid</code></td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>target-counter()</code> 交叉引用</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页眉页脚</td>\n<td>CSS 页边盒</td>\n<td><code>headerTemplate</code>/<code>footerTemplate</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型的工程口径可以归纳为一句：<strong>以页码、交叉引用、脚注这类「书的特性」为核心的文档，走 WeasyPrint 这类排版引擎；以 Web 技术栈复用、复杂 CSS Grid/Flex、动态 JS 渲染为核心的文档，走 Chrome 系。</strong> 跨境电商场景里，合规声明与条款页偏前者，而营销化的发票与装箱单往往偏后者，同一套管线里混用两个引擎是常见且合理的做法——但必须把「哪个模板走哪个引擎」写进模板元数据，而不是靠运行时猜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分页媒体的三层模型是：纸张（<code>@page</code> 的 <code>size</code>）→ 页面盒的边距围出页面区域（正文流）→ 四边的 16 个页边盒（生成内容）。三者职责不同，<code>margin</code> 为 0 会直接吞掉页边盒。</li>\n<li>断点由 <code>break-before/after/inside</code>（及 <code>page-break-*</code> 别名）与 <code>widows</code>/<code>orphans</code> 共同决定；<code>break-inside: avoid</code> 是柔性的请求，遇到高于一页的块必然被放弃，需配合内容长度约束而非硬堆。</li>\n<li>动态页眉页脚靠 <code>page</code>/<code>pages</code> 计数器、<code>string-set</code> + <code>string()</code>（文本）或 running elements（元素）；Chrome 的原生 <code>headerTemplate</code> 与 CSS 页边盒是两套机制，同时用会互相覆盖。</li>\n<li>引擎差异是真实成本：WeasyPrint 70 覆盖 Paged Media Level 3 与 GCPM 的页边盒、running elements、交叉引用；Chrome <code>printToPDF</code> 强在 Web 栈复用与 <code>printBackground</code>/<code>preferCSSPageSize</code> 等参数控制，但页边盒与 GCPM 支持有限。按「书的特性 vs Web 特性」分派模板。</li>\n<li>与本章其余内容衔接：<a href=\"./\">本章索引</a> 给出 HTML→PDF 渲染架构的整体切分，本文件聚焦版式模型，字体嵌入、资源加载与渲染确定性问题则在同章节的其他文档中展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"HTML/CSS 分页媒体与版式模型","id":"html-css-分页媒体与版式模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"@page 规则与页面选择器","id":"page-规则与页面选择器"},{"level":2,"text":"分页控制与碎片化","id":"分页控制与碎片化"},{"level":2,"text":"页边盒与生成内容","id":"页边盒与生成内容"},{"level":2,"text":"无头引擎的实现差异","id":"无头引擎的实现差异"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"无头渲染引擎选型与架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/document-pdf-label-generation-engineering/rendering-architecture-html-to-pdf/headless-render-engine-architecture"},"next":{"title":"渲染确定性、字体嵌入与资源治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/document-pdf-label-generation-engineering/rendering-architecture-html-to-pdf/render-determinism-font-embedding"}}